    "slug": "meta-google-ads-max-cpa-caps-indian-d2c-unit-margin-math",
    "title": "Meta & Google Ads Max CPA Caps for Indian D2C Brands: Why \"2.5x ROAS\" Still Loses Money Without Unit Margin Math",
    "date": "November 18, 2026",
